ZAIC_PEAK constructor is wrong. The constructor requires both the IvPDomain and the variable name string — ZAIC_PEAK(m_domain, "speed"). The original passes only a string, which doesn't match the API and will fail to compile (or silently build a broken function with no domain attached).
